sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant CollectionService
    participant Storage
    participant Compaction
    participant Reader
    
    Note over Storage: Initial State:<br/>Files with OLD compression
    
    Client->>CollectionService: update_collection_compression(<br/>new_config)
    CollectionService->>CollectionService: Validate compression config
    CollectionService->>Storage: Update metadata with<br/>new compression settings
    
    Note over Storage: Transition State:<br/>OLD files + NEW config
    
    par New Writes
        Client->>Storage: Insert vectors
        Storage->>Storage: Apply NEW compression<br/>to new files
    and Reads Handle Mixed
        Client->>Reader: Search query
        Reader->>Storage: Read files
        Storage->>Reader: Return file list<br/>with compression info
        Reader->>Reader: Detect compression<br/>per file/block
        Reader->>Reader: Apply appropriate<br/>decompression
        Reader->>Client: Return results
    end
    
    Note over Storage: Mixed State:<br/>OLD + NEW files coexist
    
    Compaction->>Compaction: Background compaction<br/>triggered
    Compaction->>Storage: Read OLD files
    Storage->>Compaction: Return with<br/>OLD compression
    Compaction->>Compaction: Decompress OLD<br/>Re-compress with NEW
    Compaction->>Storage: Write NEW files<br/>Delete OLD files
    
    loop Gradual Migration
        Compaction->>Storage: Process next batch
        Note over Storage: % of NEW files<br/>increases over time
    end
    
    Note over Storage: Final State:<br/>All files use NEW compression
    
    Client->>Reader: Future queries
    Reader->>Storage: All files uniform
    Storage->>Reader: Consistent compression
    Reader->>Client: Optimized performance